   "truncated": false,
   "text": "\r\n\r\nTamara Branson, Homer, AK.\nI vehemently oppose an underwater data center in Cook Inlet. This area is too important to our wildlife to even begin to think about disrupting this habitat. Please do not allow an underwater data center to ever be Allowed in Cook Inlet. Most sincerely, Tamara Branson\r\n\r\n"
  }
 ]
